              "id": "CVE-2026-56373",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ImageMagick: ImageMagick: Use-after-free vulnerability in PDB decoder allows denial of service or limited data corruption."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the PDB decoder that uses a stale pointer when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger this vulnerability by processing malicious PDB files to cause crashes or write a single zero byte to freed memory."
              },
