            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-80185",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "bluez: sdp-xml: BlueZ 5.86: unprivileged-local and adjacent-LE-peer leads to arbitrary code execution as root"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BlueZ sdp-xml.c type confusion via RegisterProfile(ServiceRecord) can crash bluetoothd (local DoS): a crafted nested ServiceRecord can corrupt the SDP XML parser stack so scalar union data is treated as a sequence pointer, allowing a local caller to crash bluetoothd."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
