            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-39862",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: wifi: mt76: mt7915: fix list corruption after hardware restart"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7915: fix list corruption after hardware restart\n\nSince stations are recreated from scratch, all lists that wcids are added\nto must be cleared before calling ieee80211_restart_hw.\nSet wcid-\u003esta = 0 for each wcid entry in order to ensure that they are\nnot added again before they are ready."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39862",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-39862\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2025-39862](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39862)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7915: fix list corruption after hardware restart\n\nSince stations are recreated from scratch, all lists that wcids are added\nto must be cleared before calling ieee80211_restart_hw.\nSet wcid-\u003esta = 0 for each wcid entry in order to ensure that they are\nnot added again before they are ready.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-39862**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2025-39862](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39862)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7915: fix list corruption after hardware restart\n\nSince stations are recreated from scratch, all lists that wcids are added\nto must be cleared before calling ieee80211_restart_hw.\nSet wcid-\u003esta = 0 for each wcid entry in order to ensure that they are\nnot added again before they are ready."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 7.8,
                "cvssv3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H",
