              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: fs/ntfs3: Mark inode as bad as soon as error detected in mi_enum_attr()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nfs/ntfs3: Mark inode as bad as soon as error detected in mi_enum_attr()\n\nExtended the `mi_enum_attr()` function interface with an additional\nparameter, `struct ntfs_inode *ni`, to allow marking the inode\nas bad as soon as an error is detected."
