            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-40146",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: blk-mq: fix potential deadlock while nr_requests grown"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nblk-mq: fix potential deadlock while nr_requests grown\n\nAllocate and free sched_tags while queue is freezed can deadlock[1],\nthis is a long term problem, hence allocate memory before freezing\nqueue and free memory after queue is unfreezed.\n\n[1] https://lore.kernel.org/all/0659ea8d-a463-47c8-9180-43c719e106eb@linux.ibm.com/"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-40146",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-40146\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2025-40146](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-40146)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nblk-mq: fix potential deadlock while nr_requests grown\n\nAllocate and free sched_tags while queue is freezed can deadlock[1],\nthis is a long term problem, hence allocate memory before freezing\nqueue and free memory after queue is unfreezed.\n\n[1] https://lore.kernel.org/all/0659ea8d-a463-47c8-9180-43c719e106eb@linux.ibm.com/",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-40146**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2025-40146](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-40146)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nblk-mq: fix potential deadlock while nr_requests grown\n\nAllocate and free sched_tags while queue is freezed can deadlock[1],\nthis is a long term problem, hence allocate memory before freezing\nqueue and free memory after queue is unfreezed.\n\n[1] https://lore.kernel.org/all/0659ea8d-a463-47c8-9180-43c719e106eb@linux.ibm.com/"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
