0x0000000182500000 1.0G         0x0000000641d00000 META|DUP             1/2\n0x0000000142500000 0x0000000182500000 1.0G         0x0000000601d00000 META|DUP             0/2\n0x0000000182500000 0x00000001c2500000 1.0G         0x0000000601d00000 META|DUP             1/2\n\nNow how could this possibly happen? All chunk allocation is\n---truncated---"
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 5.5,
                "cvssv3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H",
