              "id": "CVE-2026-52988",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: netfilter: nf_tables: join hook list via splice_list_rcu() in commit phase"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfilter: nf_tables: join hook list via splice_list_rcu() in commit phase\n\nPublish new hooks in the list into the basechain/flowtable using\nsplice_list_rcu() to ensure netlink dump list traversal via rcu is safe\nwhile concurrent ruleset update is going on."
              },
