                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-64068**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-64068](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-64068)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfs: Fix missing locking around retry adding new subreqs\n\nFix netfs_retry_read_subrequests() and netfs_retry_write_stream() to take\nthe appropriate lock when adding extra subrequests into\nstream-\u003esubrequests."
