            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-64077",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: netfilter: ebtables: move to two-stage removal scheme"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfilter: ebtables: move to two-stage removal scheme\n\nLike previous patches for x_tables, follow same pattern in ebtables.\nWe can't reuse xt helpers: ebt_table struct layout is incompatible.\n\ntable-\u003eops assignment is now done while still holding the ebt mutex\nto make sure we never expose partially-filled table struct."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-64077",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-64077\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-64077](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-64077)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfilter: ebtables: move to two-stage removal scheme\n\nLike previous patches for x_tables, follow same pattern in ebtables.\nWe can't reuse xt helpers: ebt_table struct layout is incompatible.\n\ntable-\u003eops assignment is now done while still holding the ebt mutex\nto make sure we never expose partially-filled table struct.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-64077**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-64077](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-64077)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfilter: ebtables: move to two-stage removal scheme\n\nLike previous patches for x_tables, follow same pattern in ebtables.\nWe can't reuse xt helpers: ebt_table struct layout is incompatible.\n\ntable-\u003eops assignment is now done while still holding the ebt mutex\nto make sure we never expose partially-filled table struct."
              },
