              "id": "CVE-2026-72355",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: netfs: Fix barriering when walking subrequest list"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfs: Fix barriering when walking subrequest list\n\nFix the barriering used when walking the subrequest list in retry as\nthere's a possibility of seeing a subreq that's just been added by the\napplication thread."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72355",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-72355\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-72355](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72355)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfs: Fix barriering when walking subrequest list\n\nFix the barriering used when walking the subrequest list in retry as\nthere's a possibility of seeing a subreq that's just been added by the\napplication thread.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-72355**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-72355](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72355)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfs: Fix barriering when walking subrequest list\n\nFix the barriering used when walking the subrequest list in retry as\nthere's a possibility of seeing a subreq that's just been added by the\napplication thread."
              },
