            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-72388",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/panthor: Always use the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring the fence lock"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/panthor: Always use the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring the fence lock\n\nSince dma_fence objects can be shared with other subsystems, they may be\naccessed from hardirq context in those drivers, and we have to take\nthat into account by also using the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring\nthe lock.\n\nWhile at it, switch to the guard model."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72388",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-72388\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-72388](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72388)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/panthor: Always use the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring the fence lock\n\nSince dma_fence objects can be shared with other subsystems, they may be\naccessed from hardirq context in those drivers, and we have to take\nthat into account by also using the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring\nthe lock.\n\nWhile at it, switch to the guard model.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-72388**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-72388](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72388)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/panthor: Always use the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring the fence lock\n\nSince dma_fence objects can be shared with other subsystems, they may be\naccessed from hardirq context in those drivers, and we have to take\nthat into account by also using the IRQ-safe variant when acquiring\nthe lock.\n\nWhile at it, switch to the guard model."
              },
              "properties": {
