            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-74548",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: forcedeth: fix UAF of txrx_stats in nv_remove"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nforcedeth: fix UAF of txrx_stats in nv_remove\n\nnv_remove() frees the per-CPU txrx_stats before unregister_netdev().\nUntil unregister completes, ndo_get_stats64, the NAPI/xmit data path,\nand nv_close()/drain may still access txrx_stats, leading to a\nuse-after-free.\n\nFree the stats only after unregister_netdev()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74548",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-74548\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.12.105-1\nLink: [CVE-2026-74548](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74548)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nforcedeth: fix UAF of txrx_stats in nv_remove\n\nnv_remove() frees the per-CPU txrx_stats before unregister_netdev().\nUntil unregister completes, ndo_get_stats64, the NAPI/xmit data path,\nand nv_close()/drain may still access txrx_stats, leading to a\nuse-after-free.\n\nFree the stats only after unregister_netdev().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-74548**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.12.105-1|[CVE-2026-74548](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74548)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nforcedeth: fix UAF of txrx_stats in nv_remove\n\nnv_remove() frees the per-CPU txrx_stats before unregister_netdev().\nUntil unregister completes, ndo_get_stats64, the NAPI/xmit data path,\nand nv_close()/drain may still access txrx_stats, leading to a\nuse-after-free.\n\nFree the stats only after unregister_netdev()."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "vulnerability",
                  "security",
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
