              "id": "CVE-2021-26934",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "An issue was discovered in the Linux kernel 4.18 through 5.10.16, as u ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An issue was discovered in the Linux kernel 4.18 through 5.10.16, as used by Xen. The backend allocation (aka be-alloc) mode of the drm_xen_front drivers was not meant to be a supported configuration, but this wasn't stated accordingly in its support status entry."
