            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-63998",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: ethtool: module: call ethnl_ops_complete() on module flash errors"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nethtool: module: call ethnl_ops_complete() on module flash errors\n\nWhen validate() fails we are skipping over ethnl_ops_complete()\neven tho we already called ethnl_ops_begin()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-63998",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-63998\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-63998](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-63998)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nethtool: module: call ethnl_ops_complete() on module flash errors\n\nWhen validate() fails we are skipping over ethnl_ops_complete()\neven tho we already called ethnl_ops_begin().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-63998**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-63998](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-63998)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nethtool: module: call ethnl_ops_complete() on module flash errors\n\nWhen validate() fails we are skipping over ethnl_ops_complete()\neven tho we already called ethnl_ops_begin()."
              },
              "properties": {
