            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-72497",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: RDMA/bnxt_re: Add a max slot check for SQ"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nRDMA/bnxt_re: Add a max slot check for SQ\n\nThe variable WQE mode must be validated against\nthe maximum slots supported by HW. The max supported\nvalue is 64K. Adding a max and min check and fail if user\nsupplied value is more than the max supported and zero."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72497",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-72497\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-72497](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72497)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nRDMA/bnxt_re: Add a max slot check for SQ\n\nThe variable WQE mode must be validated against\nthe maximum slots supported by HW. The max supported\nvalue is 64K. Adding a max and min check and fail if user\nsupplied value is more than the max supported and zero.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-72497**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-72497](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-72497)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nRDMA/bnxt_re: Add a max slot check for SQ\n\nThe variable WQE mode must be validated against\nthe maximum slots supported by HW. The max supported\nvalue is 64K. Adding a max and min check and fail if user\nsupplied value is more than the max supported and zero."
              },
