            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-80531",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  x ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nxfs: avoid UAF on sc-\u003etempip in xrep_tempfile_create\n\nLOLLM noticed a potential UAF if the tempfile creation code fails after\nit set sc-\u003etempip.  Fix that."
