                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-80531**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|UNKNOWN|linux-libc-dev|6.12.105-1|[CVE-2026-80531](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80531)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nxfs: avoid UAF on sc-\u003etempip in xrep_tempfile_create\n\nLOLLM noticed a potential UAF if the tempfile creation code fails after\nit set sc-\u003etempip.  Fix that."
