            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-80565",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  c ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncrypto: qce - fix error path in devm_qce_register_algs\n\nIf ops-\u003eregister_algs() fails, the error path repeatedly calls the same\nops-\u003eunregister_algs() from the failed registration. Use the loop index\nto unregister the previously registered algorithms instead."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80565",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-80565\nSeverity: UNKNOWN\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.12.105-1\nLink: [CVE-2026-80565](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80565)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncrypto: qce - fix error path in devm_qce_register_algs\n\nIf ops-\u003eregister_algs() fails, the error path repeatedly calls the same\nops-\u003eunregister_algs() from the failed registration. Use the loop index\nto unregister the previously registered algorithms instead.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-80565**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|UNKNOWN|linux-libc-dev|6.12.105-1|[CVE-2026-80565](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80565)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncrypto: qce - fix error path in devm_qce_register_algs\n\nIf ops-\u003eregister_algs() fails, the error path repeatedly calls the same\nops-\u003eunregister_algs() from the failed registration. Use the loop index\nto unregister the previously registered algorithms instead."
              },
